  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c9dd9d43-4a74-558d-b568-8d288f4d2c25" activityNameId="a415b225-b985-52a9-99a3-fd5e6063787e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">PEM fuel cell 2kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: PEM fuel cell 2kWe, future
The module reflects a polymer electrolyte membrane (PEM) fuel cell with 2 kW electrical output. Inventory based on information from literature for future production based on manufacturer data. Life time operation is 15 years or 80'000 h. Stack replacement every 6th. year.;
Synonyms: PEMFC, proton exchange membrane fuel cell, PEFC, polymer electrolyte fuel cell, Polymer Elektrolyt Membran Brennstoffzelle, Membran Brennstoffzelle; 
UUID: 040a4906-343c-35c4-8cbb-5e199d83670b
The module includes the most important materials used for production, the energy needed for production, planning and engineering. Also included is the transport of the raw materials the installation on the site.
Location: Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: polymer electrolyte membrane (PEM) fuel cell for stationary cogeneration. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 32%, total efficiency 87%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_040a4906-343c-35c4-8cbb-5e199d83670b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
